###### PAYMENTS ######
### Create - invalid (targetType hanya INVOICE sekarang; ORDER/DINING/DINE_IN → 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetType": "ORDER",
    "targetId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "XENDIT",
    "paymentDetail": "Testing xendit"
}

### Create - invalid (targetId = invoice yang sudah lunas → 400 "Invoice already paid")
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetType": "INVOICE",
    "targetId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "XENDIT",
    "paymentDetail": "Testing xendit"
}

### Create - XENDIT (async: status awal PENDING, tunggu webhook /payments/webhooks/xendit)
### amount = remainingAmount invoice; invoiceUrl dikembalikan di response
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetType": "INVOICE",
    "targetId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "XENDIT",
    "paymentDetail": "Testing xendit"
}

### Create - INTERNAL / Cash (langsung PAID; invoice otomatis ter-update via PaymentSettledEvent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetType": "INVOICE",
    "targetId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "Testing internal payment(cash)"
}

### Mark as expired (valid: PENDING → EXPIRED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/expire
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark as failed (valid: PENDING → FAILED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/fail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refund — TANPA body: full refund (semua item invoice yang belum refunded)
### Invoice menyesuaikan total/paid/remaining via refundItems.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refund — DENGAN body: parsial per item (hanya item yang belum refunded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderItemIds": [2]
}

### Get by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search active or GetAll
### filter: keyword, targetType (INVOICE), targetId, status (PENDING|PAID|EXPIRED|FAILED|REFUNDED), paymentProvider (INTERNAL|XENDIT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###### XENDIT WEBHOOK (publik, header X-Callback-Token) ######
### Kontrak: 200 untuk payload valid maupun deterministik-buruk (dicatat, ack agar Xendit berhenti retry);
### 401 token salah; 500 hanya kegagalan transien.
### Late payment: webhook PAID atas payment lokal EXPIRED/FAILED diterima sebagai late settlement
### (bukan 500) — payment jadi PAID, invoice ikut ter-update, log LATE_PAYMENT.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
Content-Type: application/json
X-Callback-Token: {{xenditCallbackToken}}

{
    "external_id": "INV-xxxx-xxxx",
    "status": "PAID",
    "paid_amount": 58000,
    "payment_method": "QRIS",
    "payment_channel": "QRIS",
    "currency": "IDR"
}


###### DEPRECATED / NON-ACTIVE (route tidak ada di PaymentController) ######
### Mark as paid manual — payment status hanya berubah via webhook Xendit
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update (PUT) — PaymentPutRequest & PaymentPatchRequest sudah dihapus
PUT {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetType": "INVOICE",
    "targetId": 1
}

### Update (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paymentDetail": "0000987654321"
}

### Delete (DELETE) — PaymentPutRequest & PaymentPatchRequest sudah dihapus
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
